<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  CJHQ sitemap

  lastmod: keep these honest. Google uses lastmod when it is accurate and
  starts ignoring it site-wide when it is not, so do not bulk-update every
  date on each deploy. Change a page's date only when that page's content
  actually changes.

  changefreq / priority: Google ignores both. Retained because Bing still
  reads them and they cost nothing.

  hreflang: deliberately not present. hreflang maps one URL per language,
  and this site serves both languages from the same URL via a JavaScript
  toggle, so there is no distinct French URL to point at. See the note in
  the delivery message about French indexability.

  Not listed here, on purpose:
  - /admin (also disallowed in robots.txt)
  - /resources/<slug> deep links. These open a modal and canonicalise to
    /resources, so listing them would submit URLs that point elsewhere.
    They belong here only if each is given its own title and canonical.

  Admin-created custom pages are not added automatically. Add them below
  by hand if they should be indexed.
-->
